<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3979" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aspersĭo</span></b> , ōnis,
			f.
		aspergo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a sprinkling upon</i>, <i>a
			sprinkling</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aspersione aquae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Leg. 2, 10, 24</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 3, 1</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sanguinis aspersio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Heb. 12, 24</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">ib. 1</span></i> Pet. 1, 2: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pulveris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib. 3
					Reg. 20, 28</span></i>
			.—Of <i>the laying on of colors</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aspersio fortuita,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Div. 1, 13, 23</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ut sint in aquam aspersionis,</span>”
				<i>for a water of scattering</i>, <i>separation</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Num. 19, 9</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
